==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the female form of {{p|Pyroar}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Pyroar|51}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion; both cards have the Heat Blast attack.
*'''Heat Blast''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Latias Half Deck|Latias|4}} from the {{TCG|EX Trainer Kit}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

